(One hailstone step, written as a power ballad.
 Burn is Rockstar for "parse this string as a base 10 number".)
Listen to your heart
Burn your heart with 10
Let my soul be your heart over 2
Turn my soul down
If my soul times 2 is your heart
Whisper my soul
Else
Let the sky be your heart times 3 with 1
Scream the sky
